{"id":"e2cbd640-5538-4b9a-9ae4-3bd1983b8a5f","createdAt":"2026-10-25T05:23:36.614Z","batchId":"login_claude-haiku-5-5-subscription_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5-subscription","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Sign in</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Enter your email and password to access your account.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n      <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); handleSignIn(this);\">\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"small\">Email</span>\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\">\n        </label>\n\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"row between small\">\n            <span>Password</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" onclick=\"event.preventDefault(); showMsg('Password reset link sent if the email exists.');\">Forgot password?</a>\n          </span>\n          <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Enter your password\" required minlength=\"8\" autocomplete=\"current-password\">\n        </label>\n\n        <label class=\"row gap-sm check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"remember\">\n          <span class=\"small\">Remember me for 30 days</span>\n        </label>\n\n        <div id=\"form-error\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          <div class=\"card-desc\">Email or password is incorrect. Please try again.</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\">Sign in</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n      Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Create one</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function showMsg(msg) {\n    var box = document.getElementById('form-error');\n    box.style.display = 'block';\n    box.querySelector('.card-desc').textContent = msg;\n  }\n\n  function handleSignIn(form) {\n    var email = form.email.value.trim();\n    var password = form.password.value;\n    var box = document.getElementById('form-error');\n    var valid = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email) && password.length >= 8;\n    if (valid) {\n      box.style.display = 'none';\n      showMsg('Signing in as ' + email + '…');\n    } else {\n      box.style.display = 'block';\n      box.querySelector('.card-desc').textContent = 'Enter a valid email and a password of at least 8 characters.';\n    }\n  }\n</script>","deltas":[[1847,"<"],[1852,"div class=\"page"],[1877,"\">\n  <div class=\"st"],[1900,"ack g"],[2107,"ap-lg\""],[2108," style=\"max-width:420"],[2108,"px;"],[2108,"margin:0 auto;"],[2108,"\">\n    <div class=\"st"],[2108,"ack gap-sm\">"],[2108,"\n      <h1>Sign"],[2108," in</h1>\n      <"],[2108,"p class=\"mu"],[2108,"ted\">Enter your email"],[2123," and password to access your account.</"],[2143,"p>\n    </div>"],[2336,"\n\n    <div class=\"card st"],[2336,"ack gap-l"],[2336,"g\">\n      <form class"],[2336,"=\"stack gap-l"],[2337,"g\" onsubmit=\""],[2337,"event.preventDefault("],[2337,"); hand"],[2338,"leSign"],[2338,"In(this);\">\n        "],[2355,"<label"],[2370," class=\"stack gap-s"],[2394,"m\">\n          <span class"],[2569,"=\"small\">Emai